I pushed a fix. The entry point now builds the URL with `HttpUtils::generateUri()`, as `login_path` does. `createRedirectResponse()` applies the domain check meant for targets read from the request, so in a real app `entry_point_path: https://sso.example.com/login` redirected to `/`.

BTW, I removed the known limitation from the description. Route parameters are filled from the current request, as for `login_path`.
